(2) Subject to the provisions of subsection (2-A), the following claims shall be decided by the Employees' Insurance Court, namely :--
(a) claim for the recovery of contributions from the principal employers;
(b) claim by a principal employer to recover contributions from any immediate employer;
(c) xxxxxxxxxxx;
(d) claim against a principal employer under
Section 68
;
(e) claim under Section 70 for the recovery of the value or amount of the benefits received by a person when he is not lawfully entitled thereto; and
(f) any claim for the recovery of any benefit admissible under the Act.
